# Persian "between" framing -- "بین ... و ..." / "میان ... و ..." ("between
# 2010 and 2020").  Pairs with marker_and (و), mirroring Arabic بين.
# "بین" and "میان" (beyn, miyân): Dehkhoda Dictionary and Sokhan Comprehensive
# Dictionary, s.vv. "بین" and "میان" -- both govern two coordinated terms
# joined by و.
بین
میان
